  "description": "UiPath Agent Gateway A2A agents (`uip agenthub remote-a2a-agent` / `remote-a2a-agent-user-connections`). Add an external A2A agent (Salesforce Agentforce, Microsoft Foundry, any agent that publishes an agent card) from its card link or card JSON; sign it in with an OAuth Agent 2 Agent connection or with headers from Orchestrator assets; give a person their own Agent 2 Agent connection; change it, refresh its card, show it or remove it. Agents and Maestro flows can then call it. For calling an A2A agent from a flow→uipath-maestro-flow. For MCP servers→uipath-mcp-servers.",
